stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Drafted
  Drafted --> PendingApproval: persist immutable proposal v1
  PendingApproval --> Approved: signed callback, verified approver, same version
  PendingApproval --> Denied: approver rejects
  PendingApproval --> Expired: no decision before expiry
  PendingApproval --> Invalidated: proposal is edited
  Invalidated --> PendingApproval: new version and new request
  Approved --> Executing: resume with an idempotency key
  Executing --> Completed
  Executing --> Failed
  Denied --> [*]
  Expired --> [*]
  Completed --> [*]
  Failed --> [*]
